TC
 
## 	{SA TC1i} 	{SB TC1c} 	{SC TC1n} 	{SD TC1t} 	 
1.	uyartiṇi ~eṉmaṉār makkaḷ+ cuṭṭu* ē 
2.	~aḵṟiṇi ~eṉmaṉār avar ala piṟa ~ē 
3.	~āy iru tiṇiyiṉ icikkumaṉa col= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC2i} 	{SB TC2c} 	{SC TC2n} 	{SD TC2t} 	 
1.	āṭūu ~aṟi col% makaṭūu ~aṟi col+ 
2.	pallōr aṟiyum^ colloṭu civaṇi 
3.	~a+ mu+ pāl+ col uyartiṇiyav= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC3i} 	{SB TC3c} 	{SC TC3n} 	{SD TC3t} 	 
1.	oṉṟu* aṟi col= ē pala ~aṟi col= eṉṟu* 
2.	āy iru pāl+ col aḵṟiṇiyav= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC4i} 	{SB TC4c} 	{SC TC4n} 	{SD TC4t} 	 
1.	peṇmi cuṭṭiya ~uyartiṇi maruṅkiṉ 
2.	āṇmi tirinta peyar-nili+ kiḷavi ~um^ 
3.	teyvam^ cuṭṭiya peyar-nili+ kiḷavi ~um 
4.	iv= eṉa ~aṟiyum antam^ tamakku* ila ~ē 
5.	~uyartiṇi maruṅkiṉ+ pāl pirintu* icikkum. 

 
## 	{SA TC5i} 	{SB TC5c} 	{SC TC5n} 	{SD TC5t} 	 
1.	ṉaḵkāṉ oṟṟu* ē ~āṭūu ~aṟi col. 

 
## 	{SA TC6i} 	{SB TC6c} 	{SC TC6n} 	{SD TC6t} 	 
1.	ḷaḵkāṉ oṟṟu* ē makaṭūu ~aṟi col. 

 
## 	{SA TC7i} 	{SB TC7c} 	{SC TC7n} 	{SD TC7t} 	 
1.	raḵkāṉ oṟṟu* um pakara ~iṟuti ~um* 
2.	māri+ kiḷavi ~uḷa#paṭa mūṉṟu 
3.	nēra+ tōṉṟum palar aṟi col= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC8i} 	{SB TC8c} 	{SC TC8n} 	{SD TC8t} 	 
1.	oṉṟu* aṟi kiḷavi ta ṟa ṭa ~ūrnta 
2.	kuṉṟu* iyal ukarattu* iṟuti ~ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TC9i} 	{SB TC9c} 	{SC TC9n} 	{SD TC9t} 	 
1.	a ā va eṉa varūum iṟuti 
2.	~a+ pāl% mūṉṟu* ē pala ~aṟi col= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC10i} 	{SB TC10c} 	{SC TC10n} 	{SD TC10t} 	 
1.	iru tiṇi maruṅkiṉ aim pāl aṟiya 
2.	~īṟṟiṉ* niṉṟu* icikkum patiṉōr eḻuttu* um^ 
3.	tōṟṟam^ tām ē viṉiyoṭu varum ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC11i} 	{SB TC11c} 	{SC TC11n} 	{SD TC11t} 	 
1.	viṉiyiṉ+ ^tōṉṟum pāl aṟi kiḷavi ~um 
2.	peyariṉ+ ^tōṉṟum pāl aṟi kiḷavi ~um* 
3.	mayaṅkal kūṭā tam marapiṉa ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC12i} 	{SB TC12c} 	{SC TC12n} 	{SD TC12t} 	 
1.	āṇmi tirinta peyar-nili+ kiḷavi 
2.	~āṇmi ~aṟi coṟku* āku* iṭaṉ iṉṟu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC13i} 	{SB TC13c} 	{SC TC13n} 	{SD TC13t} 	 
1.	ceppu* um viṉā ~um vaḻāal ōmpal. 

 
## 	{SA TC14i} 	{SB TC14c} 	{SC TC14n} 	{SD TC14t} 	 
1.	viṉā ~um^ ceppu* ē viṉā ~etir variṉ ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC15i} 	{SB TC15c} 	{SC TC15n} 	{SD TC15t} 	 
1.	ceppu* ē vaḻīiyiṉ-um vari-nili ~iṉṟu* ē 
2.	~a+ poruḷ puṇarnta kiḷaviyāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TC16i} 	{SB TC16c} 	{SC TC16n} 	{SD TC16t} 	 
1.	ceppiṉ um viṉāviṉ um^ ciṉi mutal+ kiḷavikku* 
2.	a+ poruḷ ākum uṟaḻ tuṇi+ poruḷ ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC17i} 	{SB TC17c} 	{SC TC17n} 	{SD TC17t} 	 
1.	takuti ~um vaḻakku* um^ taḻīiyiṉa ~oḻukum 
2.	pakuti+ kiḷavi vari-nili ~ila ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC18i} 	{SB TC18c} 	{SC TC18n} 	{SD TC18t} 	 
1.	iṉam+ cuṭṭu* illā+ paṇpu koḷ peyar+ koṭi 
2.	vaḻakku* āṟu* alla ceyyuḷ āṟu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC19i} 	{SB TC19c} 	{SC TC19n} 	{SD TC19t} 	 
1.	iyaṟki+ poruḷi ~iṟṟu* eṉa+ kiḷattal. 

 
## 	{SA TC20i} 	{SB TC20c} 	{SC TC20n} 	{SD TC20t} 	 
1.	ceyaṟki+ poruḷi ~ākkamoṭu kūṟal. 

 
## 	{SA TC21i} 	{SB TC21c} 	{SC TC21n} 	{SD TC21t} 	 
1.	ākkam^ tāṉ ē kāraṇam* mutaṟṟu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC22i} 	{SB TC22c} 	{SC TC22n} 	{SD TC22t} 	 
1.	ākkam+ kiḷavi kāraṇam iṉṟi ~um 
2.	pōkku* iṉṟu* eṉpa vaḻakkiṉ uḷ= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC23i} 	{SB TC23c} 	{SC TC23n} 	{SD TC23t} 	 
1.	pāl% mayakku* uṟṟa ~aiyam+ kiḷavi 
2.	tāṉ aṟi poruḷ vayiṉ+ paṉmi kūṟal. 

 
## 	{SA TC24i} 	{SB TC24c} 	{SC TC24n} 	{SD TC24t} 	 
1.	urupu* eṉa moḻiyiṉ-um aḵṟiṇi+ pirippiṉ -um 
2.	iru vīṟṟu* -um urittu* -ē cuṭṭum^ kāli. 

 
## 	{SA TC25i} 	{SB TC25c} 	{SC TC25n} 	{SD TC25t} 	 
1.	taṉmi cuṭṭal um urittu* eṉa moḻipa 
2.	~aṉmi+ kiḷavi vēṟu* iṭattāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TC26i} 	{SB TC26c} 	{SC TC26n} 	{SD TC26t} 	 
1.	aṭi ciṉi mutal eṉa muṟi mūṉṟu* um* mayaṅkāmi 
2.	naṭi-peṟṟu* iyalum vaṇṇam+ ciṉi+ col. 

 
## 	{SA TC27i} 	{SB TC27c} 	{SC TC27n} 	{SD TC27t} 	 
1.	oruvari+ kūṟum paṉmi+ kiḷavi ~um 
2.	oṉṟaṉi+ kūṟum paṉmi+ kiḷavi ~um 
3.	vaḻakkiṉ ākiya ~uyar-col+ kiḷavi 
4.	~ilakkaṇam* maruṅkiṉ+ col= āṟu* alla. 

 
## 	{SA TC28i} 	{SB TC28c} 	{SC TC28n} 	{SD TC28t} 	 
1.	celaviṉ um varaviṉ um^ taraviṉ um^ koṭiyiṉ um* 
2.	nilipeṟa+ tōṉṟum a+ nāl+ col= um^ 
3.	taṉmi muṉṉili paṭarkki ~eṉṉum 
4.	a+ mū ~iṭattu* um uriya ~eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TC29i} 	{SB TC29c} 	{SC TC29n} 	{SD TC28t_&&} 	 
1.	avaṟṟu* uḷ 
2.	taru col varu col= āy iru kiḷavi ~um^ 
3.	taṉmi muṉṉili ~āy īr iṭatta. 

 
## 	{SA TC30i} 	{SB TC30c} 	{SC TC30n} 	{SD TC28t_&&} 	 
1.	ēṉi ~iraṇṭu* um ēṉi ~iṭatta. 

 
## 	{SA TC31i} 	{SB TC31c} 	{SC TC31n} 	{SD TC29t} 	 
1.	yātu* evaṉ eṉṉum āy iru kiḷavi ~um 
2.	aṟiyā+ poruḷ vayiṉ+ ceṟiya+ tōṉṟum. 

 
## 	{SA TC32i} 	{SB TC32c} 	{SC TC32n} 	{SD TC30t} 	 
1.	avaṟṟu* uḷ 
2.	yātu* eṉa varūum viṉāviṉ kiḷavi 
3.	~aṟinta poruḷ vayiṉ aiyam^ tīrtaṟku+ 
4.	terinta kiḷavi ~ātal um urittu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC33i} 	{SB TC33c} 	{SC TC33n} 	{SD TC31t} 	 
1.	iṉittu* eṉa ~aṟinta ciṉi mutal+ kiḷavikku 
2.	viṉi+ paṭu tokutiyiṉ ummi vēṇṭum. 

 
## 	{SA TC34i} 	{SB TC34c} 	{SC TC34n} 	{SD TC32t} 	 
1.	maṉṉā+ poruḷ um aṉṉa ~iyaṟṟu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC35i} 	{SB TC35c} 	{SC TC35n} 	{SD TC33t} 	 
1.	e+ poruḷ āyiṉ-um allatu* il= eṉiṉ 
2.	a+ poruḷ allā+ piṟitu poruḷ kūṟal. 

 
## 	{SA TC36i} 	{SB TC36c} 	{SC TC36n} 	{SD TC34t} 	 
1.	a+ poruḷ kūṟiṉ+ cuṭṭi+ kūṟal. 

 
## 	{SA TC37i} 	{SB TC37c} 	{SC TC37n} 	{SD TC35t} 	 
1.	poruḷoṭu puṇarā+ cuṭṭu+ peyar āyiṉ-um 
2.	poruḷ vēṟupaṭāatu* oṉṟu* ākum= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC38i} 	{SB TC38c} 	{SC TC38n} 	{SD TC36t} 	 
1.	iyal#peyar kiḷavi ~um^ cuṭṭu+ peyar+ kiḷavi ~um 
2.	viṉikku* oruṅku* iyalum^ kālam^ tōṉṟiṉ+ 
3.	cuṭṭu+ peyar+ kiḷavi muṟpaṭa+ kiḷavār 
4.	iyal#peyar vaḻiya ~eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TC39i} 	{SB TC39c} 	{SC TC39n} 	{SD TC37t} 	 
1.	muṟpaṭa+ kiḷattal ceyyuḷ uḷ urittu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC40i} 	{SB TC40c} 	{SC TC40n} 	{SD TC38t} 	 
1.	cuṭṭu mutal ākiya kāraṇam+ kiḷavi ~um^ 
2.	cuṭṭu+ peyar iyaṟkiyiṉ+ ceṟiya+ tōṉṟum. 

 
## 	{SA TC41i} 	{SB TC41c} 	{SC TC41n} 	{SD TC39t} 	 
1.	ciṟappiṉ ākiya peyar-nili+ kiḷavikku* um 
2.	iyal#peyar+ kiḷavi muṟpaṭa+ kiḷavār. 

 
## 	{SA TC42i} 	{SB TC42c} 	{SC TC42n} 	{SD TC40t} 	 
1.	oru poruḷ kuṟitta vēṟu peyar+ kiḷavi 
2.	toḻil vēṟu kiḷappiṉ oṉṟu* iṭaṉ ila ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC43i} 	{SB TC43c} 	{SC TC43n} 	{SD TC41t} 	 
1.	taṉmi+ col= ē ~aḵṟiṇi+ kiḷavi ~eṉṟu* 
2.	eṇṇu-vaḻi maruṅkiṉ viravutal variyār. 

 
## 	{SA TC44i} 	{SB TC44c} 	{SC TC44n} 	{SD TC42t} 	 
1.	orumi ~eṇṇiṉ potu+ piri pāl+ col= 
2.	orumikku* allatu* eṇṇu muṟi nillātu. 

 
## 	{SA TC45i} 	{SB TC45c} 	{SC TC45n} 	{SD TC43t} 	 
1.	viyaṅkōḷ eṇṇu+ peyar tiṇi viravu variyār. 

 
## 	{SA TC46i} 	{SB TC46c} 	{SC TC46n} 	{SD TC44t} 	 
1.	vēṟu viṉi+ potu+ col oru viṉi kiḷavār. 

 
## 	{SA TC47i} 	{SB TC47c} 	{SC TC47n} 	{SD TC45t} 	 
1.	eṇṇum^ kāl um atu ~ataṉ marapu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC48i} 	{SB TC48c} 	{SC TC48n} 	{SD TC46t} 	 
1.	iraṭṭi+ kiḷavi ~iraṭṭiṉ+ pirintu* iciyā. 

 
## 	{SA TC49i} 	{SB TC49c} 	{SC TC49n} 	{SD TC47t} 	 
1.	oru peyar+ potu+ col uḷ poruḷ oḻiya+ 
2.	teripu vēṟu kiḷattal* ^talimi ~um paṉmi ~um 
3.	uyartiṇi maruṅkiṉ um aḵṟiṇi maruṅkiṉ um. 

 
## 	{SA TC50i} 	{SB TC50c} 	{SC TC50n} 	{SD TC48t} 	 
1.	peyariṉ um^ toḻiliṉ um piripavi ~ellām^ 
2.	mayaṅkal kūṭā vaḻakku vaḻi+ paṭṭaṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TC51i} 	{SB TC51c} 	{SC TC51n} 	{SD TC49t} 	 
1.	pala vayiṉāṉ um eṇṇu+ tiṇi viravu+ peyar 
2.	aḵṟiṇi muṭipiṉa ceyyuḷ uḷ= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC52i} 	{SB TC52c} 	{SC TC52n} 	{SD TC50t} 	 
1.	viṉi vēṟu-paṭūum pala-poruḷ-oru-col 
2.	viṉi vēṟu-paṭāa+ pala-poruḷ-oru-col= eṉṟu* 
3.	āy iru vakiya pala-poruḷ-oru-col. 

 
## 	{SA TC53i} 	{SB TC53c} 	{SC TC53n} 	{SD TC51t} 	 
1.	avaṟṟu* uḷ 
2.	viṉi vēṟu-paṭūum pala-poruḷ-oru-col 
3.	vēṟu-paṭu viṉiyiṉ um iṉattiṉ um^ cārpiṉ um^ 
4.	tēṟa+ tōṉṟum poruḷ* ^teri nili ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC54i} 	{SB TC54c} 	{SC TC54n} 	{SD TC52t} 	 
1.	oṉṟu viṉi maruṅkiṉ oṉṟi+ tōṉṟum. 

 
## 	{SA TC55i} 	{SB TC54c_&&} 	{SC TC55n} 	{SD TC53t} 	 
1.	viṉi vēṟupaṭāa+ pala-poruḷ-oru-col% 
2.	^niṉiyum^ kāli+ kiḷantāṅku* iyalum. 

 
## 	{SA TC56i} 	{SB TC55c} 	{SC TC56n} 	{SD TC54t} 	 
1.	kuṟittōṉ kūṟṟam^ terittu moḻi kiḷavi. 

 
## 	{SA TC57i} 	{SB TC56c} 	{SC TC57n} 	{SD TC55t} 	 
1.	kuṭimi ~āṇmi ~iḷami mūppu* ē 
2.	~aṭimi vaṉmi viruntu* ē kuḻu ~ē 
3.	peṇmi ~aracu* ē maka ~ē kuḻavi 
4.	taṉmi tiri peyar uṟuppiṉ kiḷavi 
5.	kātal ciṟappu* ē ceṟal+ col viṟal+ col eṉṟu* 
6.	ā ~aṟu mūṉṟu* um uḷa#paṭa+ tokii 
7.	~aṉṉa piṟa ~um avaṟṟoṭu civaṇi 
8.	muṉṉattiṉ uṇarum^ kiḷavi ~ellām 
9.	uyartiṇi maruṅkiṉ* ^niliyiṉa ~āyiṉ um 
10.	aḵṟiṇi maruṅkiṉ+ kiḷantāṅku* iyalum. 

 
## 	{SA TC58i} 	{SB TC57c} 	{SC TC58n} 	{SD TC56t} 	 
1.	kālam ulakam uyir ē ~uṭampu* ē 
2.	pāl vari teyvam viṉi ~ē pūtam* 
3.	ñāyiṟu tiṅkaḷ col= eṉa varūum 
4.	āy īr aintoṭu piṟa ~um aṉṉa 
5.	~ā vayiṉ varūum^ kiḷavi ~ellām 
6.	pāl pirintu* iciyā ~uyartiṇi mēṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TC59i} 	{SB TC58c} 	{SC TC59n} 	{SD TC57t} 	 
1.	niṉṟāṅku* icittal ivaṇ iyalpu* iṉṟu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC60i} 	{SB TC59c} 	{SC TC60n} 	{SD TC58t} 	 
1.	icittal um uriya vēṟu* iṭattāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TC61i} 	{SB TC60c} 	{SC TC61n} 	{SD TC59t} 	 
1.	eṭutta moḻi ~iṉam^ ceppal um urittu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC62i} 	{SB TC61c} 	{SC TC62n} 	{SD TC60t} 	 
1.	kaṇ= um^ tōḷ um* muli ~um piṟa ~um 
2.	paṉmi cuṭṭiya ciṉi-nili+ kiḷavi 
3.	paṉmi kūṟum^ kaṭappāṭu* ila ~ē 
4.	tam viṉikku* iyalum eḻuttu* alam^ kaṭi ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC63i} 	{SB TC62c} 	{SC TC63n} 	{SD TC61t} 	 
1.	vēṟṟumi tām ē ~ēḻ eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TC64i} 	{SB TC63c} 	{SC TC64n} 	{SD TC61t_&&} 	 
1.	viḷi koḷvataṉ-kaṇ viḷiyōṭu* eṭṭu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC65i} 	{SB TC64c} 	{SC TC65n} 	{SD TC62t} 	 
1.	avi tām peyar ai oṭu ku 
2.	iṉ atu kaṇ viḷi ~eṉṉum īṟṟa. 

 
## 	{SA TC66i} 	{SB TC65c} 	{SC TC66n} 	{SD TC63t} 	 
1.	avaṟṟu* uḷ 
2.	eḻuvāy vēṟṟumi peyar tōṉṟu nili ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC67i} 	{SB TC66c} 	{SC TC67n} 	{SD TC64t} 	 
1.	poruṇmi cuṭṭal viyaṅkōḷ varutal 
2.	viṉi-nili ~urittal viṉāviṟku* ēṟṟal 
3.	paṇpu koḷa varutal peyar koḷa varutal eṉṟu* 
4.	aṉṟi ~aṉittu* um peyar+ payaṉili ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC68i} 	{SB TC67c} 	{SC TC68n} 	{SD TC65t} 	 
1.	peyariṉ ākiya toki ~um ār uḷa ~ē 
2.	~av= um uriya ~a+ pālāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TC69i} 	{SB TC68c} 	{SC TC69n} 	{SD TC66t} 	 
1.	ev vayiṉ+ peyar um veḷi#paṭa+ tōṉṟi 
2.	~av= iyal* ^niliyal cevvitu* eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TC70i} 	{SB TC69c} 	{SC TC70n} 	{SD TC67t} 	 
1.	kūṟiya muṟiyiṉ urupu nili tiriyātu* 
2.	īṟu peyarkku* ākum iyaṟkiya ~eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TC71i} 	{SB TC70c} 	{SC TC71n} 	{SD TC68t} 	 
1.	peyar-nili+ kiḷavi kālam^ tōṉṟā 
2.	toḻiṉili ~oṭṭum oṉṟu* alam^ kaṭi ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC72i} 	{SB TC71c} 	{SC TC72n} 	{SD TC69t} 	 
1.	iraṇṭu* ākuvatu* ē 
2.	ai ~eṉa+ peyariya vēṟṟumi+ kiḷavi 
3.	~ev vaḻi variṉ-um viṉi ~ē viṉi+ kuṟippu* 
4.	av= iru mutaliṉ+ ^tōṉṟum atu ~ē. 

 
{SA TC72i_&&} 	{SB TC72c} 	{SC TC73n} 	{SD TC70t} 	 
1.	kāppiṉ oppiṉ ūrtiyiṉ iḻiyiṉ 
2.	ōppiṉ+ pukaḻiṉ+ paḻiyiṉ eṉṟā 
3.	peṟaliṉ iḻaviṉ+ kātaliṉ vekuḷiyiṉ+ 
4.	ceṟaliṉ uvattaliṉ+ kaṟpiṉ eṉṟā 
5.	~aṟuttaliṉ+ kuṟittaliṉ+ ^tokuttaliṉ+ pirittaliṉ* 
6.	^niṟuttaliṉ aḷaviṉ eṇṇiṉ eṉṟā 
7.	~ākkaliṉ+ cārtaliṉ+ celaviṉ+ kaṉṟaliṉ* 
8.	^nōkkaliṉ añcaliṉ+ citippiṉ eṉṟā 
